    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Its second attack in a Round on the same target deals +1d6 (4d6) if the first hit. In an Ambush from stealth, +1 to hit and its first attack that Round deals +1d6. With Chameleon Coating or Optical Camo on, 5s count as 6s for Critical Injuries, and after moving 2m you can make a Leaping Strike: lunge 4m and attack, as half its ROF2, without spending MOVE, for 4d6. With Speedware active, LUCK spent on its attacks gives +1 more.</p><p><strong>Class:</strong> Iconic EQ Heavy Melee<br><strong>Range table:</strong> Melee<br><strong>Damage:</strong> 3d6<br><strong>Fabrication:</strong> N/A (Cannot be Fabricated. Must be gifted or scavenged from Sandayu Oda. So, good luck with that)</p><p><small>Item Compendium (2070) • Iconics</small></p>"
